          "file": "SymplecticStafford/Paper/Setting.lean",
          "name": "SymplecticStafford.Paper.FilteredAlgebraData"
        }
      ],
      "depends_on": [],
      "notes": "Surjective multiplicative symbol maps with precisely the lower-piece kernel encode gr U ≃ G. Characteristic zero implies Infinite k; finite type gives Noetherian G. The internal theorem only needs Infinite k and Noetherian G and does not require U infinite-dimensional. The challenge retains the manuscript hypotheses. Nonnegative filtration extends by zero at negative indices."
